WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:03.434
-Republicans have been
quietly hoping

00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:04.734
that Donald Trump
will magically disappear

00:00:04.734 --> 00:00:07.000
as he kicks off
a 2024 campaign

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.801
that no one except his
hard-core fans seem to want.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.834
And now there's a chance
Republicans will get their wish

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:14.901
as Manhattan prosecutors
present evidence to a grand jury

00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:17.434
considering possible
criminal charges against Trump

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.667
and the Stormy Daniels
hush-money scandal.

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.701
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:23.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:25.667
♪♪

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.767
I've got to say,
it's very weird to see

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:30.767
Donald Trump just out there,
campaigning for president,

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:32.734
as if he didn't
orchestrate a coup

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:34.367
to overthrow American democracy.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.067
It's like a burglar

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.434
who climbed through a window,
set off the alarms,

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.133
scrambled back out,
and said to himself,

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.968
"Maybe I'll just go
ring the doorbell.

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:46.367
They probably won't recognize me
if I take the mask off."

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:48.767
He's hoping we all just forget
about his coup attempt.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:51.000
Like when George tried
to show up to work on Monday

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.901
after quitting on Friday.
"The coup?

00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:55.367
You guys
thought that was serious?

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:57.200
You just don't know
my sense of humor."

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:00.767
And as crazy
as it may seem,

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:02.567
Trump is already
racking up endorsements

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:04.868
from Republicans
like Ohio Senator J.D. Vance

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:06.934
and South Carolina Senator
Lindsey Graham,

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:09.934
who explained his decision
to back Trump this way.

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:11.734
-I know the downside of Trump,

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:14.133
but let me tell you
about the upside of Trump.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:18.067
I am for Trump not because
of the flaws of anybody else.

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:20.934
I'm for Donald Trump 'cause
I know what I'm gonna get.

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:24.334
-Yeah, you know what you're
gonna get with herpes, too,

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:27.033
but I'm not sure
that's a selling point.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:28.534
Lindsey Graham's
like Forrest Gump

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.234
if all he ever did
was sit on that bench.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:33.968
"My memaw always said life
is like a box of frozen shrimp

00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:35.434
you left out in the sun.

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:38.934
You know exactly what you're
gonna get -- food poisoning."

00:01:38.934 --> 00:01:40.767
With that said,
Lindsey isn't all wrong

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.167
about knowing
what you're gonna get

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:44.634
because Trump is just out there
doing his usual shtick,

00:01:44.634 --> 00:01:47.067
flying from state to state,
whining about all the stuff

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:49.634
he usually whines about,
like windmills.

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:53.200
-We demand windmills be built
on our oceans,

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.234
our prairies, our mountains
and our plains,

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:57.801
only to realize that
they're killing all our eagles

00:01:57.801 --> 00:02:00.834
and our birds.
If you kill a bald eagle,

00:02:00.834 --> 00:02:03.367
they put you in jail
for five years.

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:06.234
But the windmills
knock out thousands of them.

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:09.200
Nothing happens.
And it's the most expensive

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:12.400
and least reliable form
of energy on the planet.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:17.534
And the wind turbines
are all made in China.

00:02:17.534 --> 00:02:18.801
Some are made in Germany,

00:02:18.801 --> 00:02:20.667
but most of them
are made in China.

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:25.000
-Really trying to recapture
that 2016 magic all over again,

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.634
even leaning
into the word "China."

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:30.400
Except his voice is
so much more degraded now.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.901
Used to be up here --
"China!" --

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:33.567
but now he's down here --
"China."

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:35.300
It's more -- it's a growl.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.634
He sounds like a pit bull

00:02:36.634 --> 00:02:39.267
who smokes
a pack of Marlboros a day.

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:41.267
"How about this?
How about you fetch?"

00:02:41.267 --> 00:02:42.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.834 --> 00:02:45.133
"You like the ball so much,
stop chucking it around."

00:02:45.133 --> 00:02:46.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.334 --> 00:02:48.367
Also, I like how he tells
everyone in the audience,

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:50.734
"If you kill a bald eagle,
you go to jail for five years,"

00:02:50.734 --> 00:02:53.701
which definitely means
that after this happened...

00:02:57.234 --> 00:02:59.968
...Trump said, "I'm gonna kill
that bald eagle."

00:02:59.968 --> 00:03:02.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:03.701
And someone told him not to

00:03:03.701 --> 00:03:06.400
because he'd go to jail
for five years.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.734
But with a few exceptions,

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:09.901
Republicans are all dreading
another Trump campaign.

00:03:09.901 --> 00:03:11.801
That's the central problem
they're facing right now.

00:03:11.801 --> 00:03:13.334
They all quietly want
Trump gone,

00:03:13.334 --> 00:03:15.601
but nobody wants to be
the one to stop him.

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:17.601
It's like when you leave
a window open

00:03:17.601 --> 00:03:20.200
and a bird gets in your house
and your whole family's

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.434
hiding behind the furniture
and yelling ideas.

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:25.434
"Throw a blanket on it!"
"Somebody make cat sounds!"

00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:27.567
"Put some birdseed
on the windowsill!"

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:30.968
And then your drunk Aunt Vera
just snatches it out of the air

00:03:30.968 --> 00:03:33.033
and stuffs it
through the mail slot

00:03:33.033 --> 00:03:34.601
without setting down
her Michelob.

00:03:34.601 --> 00:03:36.934
But, unfortunately,

00:03:36.934 --> 00:03:40.200
the Republicans don't have an
Aunt Vera to get rid of Trump.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.501
So far, the only
other Republican

00:03:41.501 --> 00:03:43.534
who seems to be running
for sure is Nikki Haley,

00:03:43.534 --> 00:03:45.267
Trump's former U.N. ambassador.

00:03:45.267 --> 00:03:47.267
But it's hard for me
to imagine Haley

00:03:47.267 --> 00:03:49.701
gaining much traction
in a race against Trump,

00:03:49.701 --> 00:03:52.567
given that she devoted herself
fully to the cult of Trumpism

00:03:52.567 --> 00:03:55.434
and even pledged to support him
if he ran again in 2024.

00:03:55.434 --> 00:03:58.801
And by the way,
she said this in 2021,

00:03:58.801 --> 00:04:02.100
after -- after --
the January 6th insurrection.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.501
-He still has
a lot of popularity.

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:06.000
If he runs again in 2024,
will you support him?

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.968
-Yes.

00:04:07.968 --> 00:04:09.868
-If he decides
that he's going to run,

00:04:09.868 --> 00:04:11.701
would that preclude
any sort of run

00:04:11.701 --> 00:04:13.467
that you would possibly
make yourself?

00:04:13.467 --> 00:04:16.133
-I would not run if
President Trump ran.

00:04:16.133 --> 00:04:18.167
-That was in April 2021,

00:04:18.167 --> 00:04:19.968
three months
after the insurrection,

00:04:19.968 --> 00:04:21.634
and she still said
she would support him.

00:04:21.634 --> 00:04:24.300
I mean, what changed?
Were the Trump NFTs

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.734
her breaking point?
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:28.701
"I will stand by insurrection
and election tampering

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:30.133
and financial impropriety.

00:04:30.133 --> 00:04:33.000
But when an adult man
sells an NFT of himself

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:37.534
as a superhero, I am out."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:37.534 --> 00:04:39.100
And can you imagine
what Trump will say about her

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.701
if they're ever on
a debate stage together?

00:04:40.701 --> 00:04:42.868
"Nikki's very disloyal.
She lied and said

00:04:42.868 --> 00:04:44.367
she wouldn't run against me.
That's not nice.

00:04:44.367 --> 00:04:47.734
Plus, many people are saying
she strangled a bald eagle."

00:04:47.734 --> 00:04:49.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.467 --> 00:04:52.067
So Republicans are refusing
to confront Trump head-on,

00:04:52.067 --> 00:04:54.901
instead deciding to hope
he magically disappears,

00:04:54.901 --> 00:04:56.234
just like they did in 2016.

00:04:56.234 --> 00:04:58.267
One Republican
told "The Atlantic" magazine,

00:04:58.267 --> 00:05:00.901
"It's like 2016 all over again,
only more fatalistic."

00:05:00.901 --> 00:05:03.567
And the writer of that piece
told CNN that Republicans want

00:05:03.567 --> 00:05:06.000
Trump gone, but also have
no plan for getting rid of him.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:09.534
-It was striking
how consistently

00:05:09.534 --> 00:05:12.167
I heard, "The party
needs to move on from Trump.

00:05:12.167 --> 00:05:14.267
We need to find a way
to get rid of Trump.

00:05:14.267 --> 00:05:15.601
We're way better off
without Trump."

00:05:15.601 --> 00:05:16.734
But then when I would ask,
"Okay.

00:05:16.734 --> 00:05:18.634
What's the plan
for that to happen?"

00:05:18.634 --> 00:05:21.300
it would immediately move
into hypotheticals.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.834
Maybe he'll get indicted
and his legal problems

00:05:23.834 --> 00:05:25.634
will subsume him.

00:05:25.634 --> 00:05:27.634
Maybe he'll get bored
and drop out.

00:05:27.634 --> 00:05:29.734
Maybe he'll lose his attention."

00:05:29.734 --> 00:05:33.868
Some people, you know,
clung to this long-held delusion

00:05:33.868 --> 00:05:36.501
that maybe he would become
a different person

00:05:36.501 --> 00:05:38.434
and bow out graciously
and make room

00:05:38.434 --> 00:05:40.734
for the next generation
of Republican leaders.

00:05:40.734 --> 00:05:42.667
-Who are these people
still clinging to

00:05:42.667 --> 00:05:45.734
the fantasy that Trump
will bow out graciously?

00:05:45.734 --> 00:05:48.200
He can't even bow normally.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.934
[ Laughter ]

00:05:49.934 --> 00:05:52.334
Bow out graciously?
When he lost in 2020,

00:05:52.334 --> 00:05:54.601
he sent an army of Oath Keepers
and werewolves

00:05:54.601 --> 00:05:56.968
to kill his own vice president.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.968 --> 00:05:58.634
The only reason
Mike Pence got away

00:05:58.634 --> 00:06:00.734
is that he's a fast runner.

00:06:00.734 --> 00:06:02.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:02.434 --> 00:06:04.267
And just imagine
how much faster he'd be

00:06:04.267 --> 00:06:06.501
if he didn't also clap
while he was running.

00:06:06.501 --> 00:06:07.634
[ Laughter ]

00:06:07.634 --> 00:06:09.434
Pence looks like
an overeager dad

00:06:09.434 --> 00:06:11.434
running to the dance floor
at a wedding.

00:06:11.434 --> 00:06:13.734
"I was in the bathroom
when I heard the deejay

00:06:13.734 --> 00:06:15.567
introduce 'The Electric Slide.'"

00:06:15.567 --> 00:06:17.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:17.033 --> 00:06:18.300
Seriously, if you think
Donald Trump

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:21.200
is going to suddenly change
his personality now,

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.400
at the age of 76,
after eight years in politics

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.067
and an attempted coup
to stay in power,

00:06:26.067 --> 00:06:27.501
you're crazier than those
QAnon people

00:06:27.501 --> 00:06:30.300
who think JFK Jr. is gonna
come back from the dead.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:31.801
It's never going to happen.

00:06:31.801 --> 00:06:35.968
If your personality changes
at 76, you don't get credit.

00:06:35.968 --> 00:06:37.734
You get put in a home.

00:06:37.734 --> 00:06:39.567
[ Laughter ]

00:06:39.567 --> 00:06:42.767
I guess the only path that
remains viable for Republicans

00:06:42.767 --> 00:06:44.467
hoping Trump
will magically disappear

00:06:44.467 --> 00:06:46.767
without having to challenge him
directly is an indictment

00:06:46.767 --> 00:06:49.000
because Trump is facing
a growing number of serious

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.100
criminal investigations

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:51.367
in a bunch
of different jurisdictions.

00:06:51.367 --> 00:06:53.133
There's at least
two grand juries

00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:55.567
looking into the coup attempt
and the fake electors scheme.

00:06:55.567 --> 00:06:58.100
The Michigan attorney general
is also looking into

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.067
the fake electors,
a special counsel's

00:07:00.067 --> 00:07:01.400
investigating Trump's refusal

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.267
to give back stolen
classified documents,

00:07:03.267 --> 00:07:05.167
and a district attorney
in Georgia

00:07:05.167 --> 00:07:07.334
has said charges
could be imminent

00:07:07.334 --> 00:07:09.000
in the investigation
of Trump's phone call

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.734
trying to tamper with
the vote count in the state.

00:07:10.734 --> 00:07:12.801
And on top of all that,
prosecutors in Manhattan

00:07:12.801 --> 00:07:14.667
are reviving an investigation
into Trump's

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:16.100
secret hush-money payments

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:18.901
to cover up his alleged affairs
during his first campaign.

00:07:18.901 --> 00:07:21.334
-A New York prosecutor
is making a big move

00:07:21.334 --> 00:07:23.567
that could mean
potential criminal charges

00:07:23.567 --> 00:07:25.501
for former president
Donald Trump

00:07:25.501 --> 00:07:28.868
just as he ramps up for his
third run for the White House.

00:07:28.868 --> 00:07:30.767
The New York Times
says the Manhattan D.A.

00:07:30.767 --> 00:07:34.133
started presenting evidence
to a grand jury today

00:07:34.133 --> 00:07:36.434
about Donald Trump's role
in paying hush money

00:07:36.434 --> 00:07:38.434
to porn star Stormy Daniels

00:07:38.434 --> 00:07:40.567
during his first
presidential campaign.

00:07:40.567 --> 00:07:42.901
NBC News has confirmed
that the grand jury

00:07:42.901 --> 00:07:44.701
has been convened for this.

00:07:44.701 --> 00:07:46.801
Former Trump lawyer,
Michael Cohen,

00:07:46.801 --> 00:07:48.834
who went to federal prison
for his role

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:50.434
in the hush-money payments,

00:07:50.434 --> 00:07:53.100
is now playing witness
in this latest case.

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:56.000
-Wait. They're investigating
the Stormy Daniels case again?

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.701
Man, they really are bringing
back storylines from 2016.

00:07:59.701 --> 00:08:02.133
If they arrest Trump,
I hope the FBI agent

00:08:02.133 --> 00:08:04.300
who puts him in cuffs
rips off his mask and says,

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.601
"Hello, Donald, it's me -- Jeb."

00:08:06.601 --> 00:08:08.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:08.667 --> 00:08:10.968
"It's too bad you're handcuffed
or I'd tell you to..."

00:08:10.968 --> 00:08:12.000
-Please clap.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.834
[ Laughter ]

00:08:13.834 --> 00:08:16.033
"Did somebody say,
'Please clap'?"

00:08:16.033 --> 00:08:18.133
[ Laughter ]

00:08:18.133 --> 00:08:19.801
Well, you know, I think that's
the last time

00:08:19.801 --> 00:08:22.400
we're gonna use the clip of
Mike Pence running and clapping.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.734
Unless would it be fun
to see what it would look like

00:08:25.734 --> 00:08:28.667
if the tarmac lights
were hooked up to a clapper?

00:08:28.667 --> 00:08:34.267
[ Laughter ]

00:08:34.267 --> 00:08:36.868
I think it was -- I think it was
a little bit of fun.

00:08:36.868 --> 00:08:38.300
[ Laughter ]

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:40.901
Now, you might be asking,
"Why are Manhattan prosecutors

00:08:40.901 --> 00:08:43.067
diving back into the
Stormy Daniels case now?"

00:08:43.067 --> 00:08:44.734
Well, for one thing,
it was always very weird

00:08:44.734 --> 00:08:46.501
that the only guy
who did any jail time

00:08:46.501 --> 00:08:48.534
was Trump's ex fixer,
Michael Cohen,

00:08:48.534 --> 00:08:50.200
even though it was Trump himself

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.734
who orchestrated the scheme
and even signed the check.

00:08:52.734 --> 00:08:54.467
They literally
have his signature

00:08:54.467 --> 00:08:55.701
on a hush-money payment

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:57.467
for which one of his underlings
went to jail.

00:08:57.467 --> 00:08:59.467
The only way it could have been
more damning is if,

00:08:59.467 --> 00:09:01.801
in the memo, Trump wrote
"For hush money

00:09:01.801 --> 00:09:03.267
plus killing that bald eagle."

00:09:03.267 --> 00:09:04.367
[ Laughter ]

00:09:04.367 --> 00:09:05.667
And yet Trump wasn't charged.

00:09:05.667 --> 00:09:07.767
In fact, it seems like part
of the reason prosecutors

00:09:07.767 --> 00:09:09.934
are reopening the case
is that they came very close

00:09:09.934 --> 00:09:11.234
to charging him the first time.

00:09:11.234 --> 00:09:13.334
CNN reported that prosecutors
had actually weighed

00:09:13.334 --> 00:09:15.033
whether to bring a case
against Trump

00:09:15.033 --> 00:09:16.334
near the end of his presidency,

00:09:16.334 --> 00:09:18.901
but decided that the
other investigations of Trump

00:09:18.901 --> 00:09:20.434
were probably more important.

00:09:42.033 --> 00:09:44.167
So, basically,
Trump got away with one crime

00:09:44.167 --> 00:09:46.934
by committing other
even worse crimes.

00:09:46.934 --> 00:09:49.534
It's a classic legal strategy.
People don't know this,

00:09:49.534 --> 00:09:52.300
but the Son of Sam
only went on that killing spree

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.000
so he wouldn't go to jail
for shoplifting.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.133
[ Laughter ]

00:09:55.133 --> 00:09:58.934
Shoplifting his dog
also told him to do.

00:09:58.934 --> 00:10:00.734
"Take the Twizzlers,
but don't pay for them."

00:10:00.734 --> 00:10:02.200
[ Laughter ]

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:05.667
Seriously, who knew there was
this giant loophole in the law

00:10:05.667 --> 00:10:07.300
where you could get away
with one crime

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.834
by committing
an even worse crime?

00:10:08.834 --> 00:10:12.200
Are there commercials about this
that I haven't seen?

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.167
Are you worried about
a parking fine?

00:10:14.167 --> 00:10:16.300
Are you under investigation
for petty theft?

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.968
Did you get caught shoplifting?

00:10:17.968 --> 00:10:19.667
Why not call Meyers &amp; Meyers
right now?

00:10:19.667 --> 00:10:20.968
We'll help you stay out of jail

00:10:20.968 --> 00:10:22.367
by doing something way worse.

00:10:22.367 --> 00:10:25.100
Bank robbery, arson,
even murder -- we'll help you

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.701
commit a much more
heinous crime

00:10:26.701 --> 00:10:30.601
so prosecutors will let you off
on your smaller crimes.

00:10:30.601 --> 00:10:33.601
The only thing we don't do
is dognapping!

00:10:33.601 --> 00:10:37.067
Stop calling us and asking us
if we do dognapping.

00:10:37.067 --> 00:10:39.634
We will not help
lure your neighbor's dog

00:10:39.634 --> 00:10:42.701
into a burlap sack
using sausage-flavored treats.

00:10:42.701 --> 00:10:46.133
Stop asking us to do that!

00:10:46.133 --> 00:10:48.400
We don't do that!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:49.767
Anyway,
if you need help, call now.

00:10:49.767 --> 00:10:51.634
Meyers &amp; Meyers,
personal attorneys.

00:10:51.634 --> 00:10:54.734
We'll help you beat the rap
by doing even worse crap.

00:10:54.734 --> 00:10:57.601
Except for dognapping!

00:10:57.601 --> 00:10:58.767
And we also won't...

00:10:58.767 --> 00:11:00.200
Kill a bald eagle.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.033
[ Laughter ]

00:11:02.033 --> 00:11:04.100
This has been...

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.334
"A Closer Look"!

00:11:05.334 --> 00:11:07.634
♪♪

00:11:07.634 --> 00:11:09.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

